00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,067
C, black.

2
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:11,848
Calomel disproportionates: one mercury becomes the white amido compound, the other becomes free, finely divided mercury, which looks black.

3
00:00:11,848 --> 00:00:17,226
Scarlet is mercury two iodide, and yellow is mercury two oxide.

